ry":"该条目介绍了一个针对韩国公开公共API的多步骤工具调用评测基准，并提出一种基于实时执行验证的图结构数据合成方法，用于生成可执行的多步骤轨迹，以提升开源模型的调用能力。","title":"Multi-Step Tool-Calling over Korean Open Public APIs: A Benchmark and a Data-Synthesis Recipe"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_58b887b188c21f738ae7303a0c1258c6bbc2b89938c1c821c386f5219a8d2ad6","internal_url":"/posts/20260909-arxiv-necessary-or-sufficient-evaluating-llm-explanation-2-eb6fbda780/","observation_id":"obs_eb6fbda78057317da7e1ae25dbc32e2c465b19127fe4d6b3d5558b20c568bcc2","published_at":"2026-09-04T17:37:17Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该研究通过黑盒干预衡量语言模型生成的因素解释是否满足必要性（改变该因素会导致输出变化）或充分性（保留该因素而移除其他可变信息仍能保持输出），并把解释排名与实验得分进行相关性分析，涉及两类合成任务。","title":"Necessary or Sufficient? Evaluating LLM Explanations With Behavioural Evidence"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_bb7b27f60f531efebb90b330122033e4492bc877ef61a3ac97a071463cd53bf8","internal_url":"/posts/20260909-arxiv-molecular-déjà-vu-digit-level-retrieval-of-publish-2-8d70f60d09/","observation_id":"obs_8d70f60d09d2aa5f2953489a117f8f12b0762267fb507127b6c15eab4d9754ad","published_at":"2026-09-04T17:32:48Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该内容报告了对前沿语言模型在分子属性回归基准上是否会逐字检索已发布数值的研究。作者对多个模型在多个基准上进行审计，比较模型在相同分子和相同提示下的输出与已有文献数值的匹配程度，并分析了推理层次对检索行为的影响。","title":"Molecular Déjà Vu: Digit-Level Retrieval of Published Values in Frontier Language Models"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_814f855b295c75f7ec9d6beda5bcd0eadc1fb285e97103a75ddc251af061e548","internal_url":"/posts/20260905-blogs_podcasts-designing-lifecycle-policies-for-agentcore-memory-0-c620d7b2d0/","observation_id":"obs_c620d7b2d0c6a9529b6c4a7972b85e9a5496d506de1f20cce6e3493f86273128","published_at":"2026-09-04T17:20:04Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这段内容介绍了如何对 AI Agent 的记忆进行生命周期管理，通过将记忆分类并采用过期时间、相关性衰减和合并三种策略定期清理记忆，使长期运行的 Agent 保持有效性并避免过时信息干扰。","title":"Designing lifecycle policies for AgentCore memory"},{"associated_obs